# Database Schema

Ref: `supabase/migrations/20250222000000_initial_schema.sql`, `supabase/migrations/20250222000001_storage_documents.sql`

**Tabelas:**

- **resumes** — id, user_id, parsed_data (JSONB → ResumeData), created_at, updated_at.
- **analyses** — id, user_id, resume_id, job_snapshot (JSONB → jobSnapshotSchema), score (0–100), optimized_score (0–100, opcional), matched_skills_count (≥0), user_hard_skills (JSONB array), user_soft_skills (JSONB array), missing_hard_skills (JSONB array), missing_soft_skills (JSONB array), status (pending|pending_payment|completed|abandoned), optimized_resume_data (JSONB, opcional; preenchido ao concluir o passo de melhorar currículo em generateResumePreview; usado na geração do documento otimizado no download), created_at.
- **user_credits** — user_id (PK), credits (≥0, default 0), updated_at.
- **purchases** — id, payment_provider (TEXT), external_id (TEXT), user_id, package_id, credits_granted (>0), created_at. UNIQUE (payment_provider, external_id). Webhook Stripe e aplicação de PIX (applyPixPayment) escrevem; usuário só lê próprio.
- **pix_pending_charges** — charge_id (PK), user_id, package_id, analysis_id (opcional), created_at. Contexto para reconciliação de PIX (AbacatePay); usuário insere/select/delete próprio.
- **optimized_documents** — id, analysis_id, file_path, format (pdf|docx), created_at.

**Mapping:** parsed_data → resumeDataSchema; job_snapshot → jobSnapshotSchema; user_hard_skills/user_soft_skills = skills matched; missing_hard_skills/missing_soft_skills = skills faltantes; status atualizado em runSkillsMatch e generateResumePreview.

**RLS:** resumes = FOR ALL próprio. **analyses** = SELECT e INSERT próprio; UPDATE só service role (document-preview). user_credits = apenas SELECT próprio; escritas só service role. purchases = apenas SELECT próprio; INSERT só service role. **optimized_documents** = SELECT via análise do user; INSERT só service role (document-export). pix_pending_charges = insert_own, select_own, delete_own.

**Storage:** bucket `documents` (INSERT em `storage.buckets` na migration `20250222000001_storage_documents.sql`); política **SELECT** própria (`documents_select_own`, path `{user_id}/*`). Upload/delete só service role no servidor.
